From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: H96 build <builder@h96-build>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/59] PCI: rockchip: pcie-dma: include vmalloc.h

vmalloc(), vmap(), vfree() and VM_MAP are no longer reached through
other headers on 6.12; CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_PCIE_DMA_OBJ=y (carried from
config.v80) failed to build.

H96 series: 6.12 build fix, t1.
---
 drivers/pci/controller/rockchip-pcie-dma.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pci/controller/rockchip-pcie-dma.c b/drivers/pci/controller/rockchip-pcie-dma.c
index 6ffd33514..3f28d54de 100644
--- a/drivers/pci/controller/rockchip-pcie-dma.c
+++ b/drivers/pci/controller/rockchip-pcie-dma.c
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include <linux/signal.h>
 #include <linux/types.h>
 #include <linux/uaccess.h>
+#include <linux/vmalloc.h>
 #include <uapi/linux/rk-pcie-dma.h>
 
 #include "rockchip-pcie-dma.h"
